    "text": "Savannah Tribune\nwebsite\nSavannah\nSCCPSS Ribbon Cutting Ceremony For Windsor Forest High School\nBy Savannah Tribune,\n15 hours agoThe Savannah-Chatham County Public School System (SCCPSS) will hold a ribbon cutting ceremony to celebrate the opening of Windsor Forest High School on Friday, August 8, 2025, at 3:30 p.m. The new Windsor Forest High School, funded by ESPLOST IV at a cost of $92 million, is a state-of-the-art facility...\n4",
